                                "sense_id": "d5734d94-1b8f-364e-a448-24f992276a59",
                                "text": "It is needless to remark on the modesty of this epithet when assumed by men;—and by such men! by the lord Johns, and the lord Harrys, who even now abstort from us more homage than we yield to Heaven!"
                            },
                            {
