                                "sense_id": "d5734d94-1b8f-364e-a448-24f992276a59",
                                "text": "How stillsome and flooth could suburbity be Were the gramsters abstorted by felo-de-se- For I daminate grams, and they scruciate me!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79fa4de1-fe7f-454b-8f54-b8b1c67a6ff5",
                                "sense_id": "d5734d94-1b8f-364e-a448-24f992276a59",
                                "text": "he has violently and wrongfully abstorted it from them."
